Package: sqlr.sqlite
Title: SQLite Dialect for sqlr
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Nicolas", "Bennett", email = "r@nbenn.ch", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description:
    Renders the schema representation of the sqlr package as SQLite data
    definition language, and reflects a live SQLite database back into that
    representation.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    sqlr,
    S7,
    DBI
Suggests:
    RSQLite,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
URL: https://github.com/nbenn/sqlr
